# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Render and scratch output. Deliberately narrow: the skill *bundles* media
# (still.jpg plates, site/audio/loop.mp3), so a blanket *.mp4/*.wav rule would
# silently drop shipped assets. Only ignore these inside style/pattern work dirs.
assets/styles/*/out/
assets/styles/*/renders/
assets/styles/*/frames/
assets/patterns/*/out/
assets/patterns/*/renders/
out/
tmp/

